1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC,
"Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,080
Hello, is order 0354 ready?

4
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,560
Let me check.

5
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:51,880
Please hurry.

6
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,480
In modern society,

7
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,120
- Xuan.
- most women...

8
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,679
are becoming more daring
in pursuing...

9
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,280
what they love and aspire to.

10
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,640
Their dreams...

11
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,760
seldom come to a halt
simply because of their gender.

12
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,840
Their careers...

13
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:11,640
also take on diverse colors...

14
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,880
precisely because of their gender.

15
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,559
(Xinhui Boxing)

16
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,920
Women are increasingly realizing...

17
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:18,080
that instead of waiting for a hero,

18
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,119
it's better...

19
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,120
to become the warriors...

20
00:02:21,121 --> 00:02:22,480
who overcome all obstacles
themselves.

21
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,080
Through their own hard work
and sweat,

22
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,960
they gain social recognition
and respect.

23
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,880
- Thank you, ma'am. Goodbye.
- Would you trust a female driver?

24
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,040
Take care.

25
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:35,760
Would you trust
a female doctor's medical expertise?

26
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,080
Would you trust...

27
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:42,280
a female pilot's flying skills?

28
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,560
(Episode 17: Fly, Girl!)

29
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:16,880
Xiao Ruan,

30
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,080
listen to me.

31
00:03:18,081 --> 00:03:20,840
First of all, this is absolutely not
what you saw online.

32
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:23,119
Secondly, our PR department
is fully prepared.

33
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,240
We'll release a statement today.

34
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,759
This isn't just for you,

35
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,319
it's also for the image
of all of Hengshi.

36
00:03:27,320 --> 00:03:29,960
So we will definitely handle this
with the utmost seriousness.

37
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:32,080
Most importantly,

38
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,400
Mr. Fu is very, very angry.

39
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:36,680
He was so restless yesterday
that he didn't sleep all night.

40
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,280
He's just afraid
you will misunderstand.

41
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,080
So he's already dealing with it.

42
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,160
Are you finished?

43
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,280
If you are,

44
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,760
then let him tell me himself.

45
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,399
Xiao Ruan, can you...

46
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,200
promise to talk things out calmly?

47
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:50,680
Please don't fight, okay?

48
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,520
Look at the timing.
They happen to be on patrol.

49
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:04,520
All right, get back to work.

50
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,560
What's that "ah" for?

51
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,120
Go on. Get back to work. Hurry.

52
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:14,680
Well, Mr. Fu is already
in his office.

53
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,120
He didn't sleep a wink last night.

54
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,920
He has been waiting here
for you since early morning.

55
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:20,480
Please, talk to him nicely.

56
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,040
Didn't you say yesterday
that we should talk?

57
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,600
Go ahead.

58
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,560
Come, Xiao Ruan.

59
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,320
Please.

60
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,280
I'll start then.

61
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,480
Li Zhi Huai and I...

62
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,160
are just ordinary friends.

63
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,320
Continue.

64
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,800
Her father was
my high school teacher.

65
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,720
We ran into each other in Chuncheng.

66
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,360
Then we returned
to Jiangcheng together.

67
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,400
After that,
when my teacher found out,

68
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,720
he insisted on inviting me
to his home for a drink.

69
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,040
I had to show respect...

70
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,640
to my teacher.

71
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,760
That was the day
you drank too much...

72
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,480
and made me wait until late.

73
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:21,640
Yes.

74
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:22,720
But I didn't
actually drink too much.

75
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,760
During that period,
I was just very busy with work.

76
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,160
- I was exhausted.
- You're very stubborn, aren't you?

77
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:31,040
Then what about the flowers?

78
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:32,240
The flowers...

79
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,360
That day was my teacher's birthday.

80
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,320
I didn't go in person.

81
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,360
So I asked Bai Yang...

82
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:38,840
to order some flowers.

83
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,000
The florist delivered them.

84
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:41,400
Yes, Xiao Ruan,

85
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:42,920
I can vouch for him.

86
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,559
Look, here's the payment record
and the electronic invoice.

87
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:47,400
(Receipt,
Sunflowers and Roses Bouquet)

88
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:50,759
(Li Zhi Huai's Manager)

89
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:51,760
Here's trouble.

90
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:53,880
Her manager is calling.

91
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:00,880
Answer it.

92
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,519
Hello, Bai Yang.

93
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,520
It's Ying.

94
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:08,000
I'm looking for Mr. Fu.

95
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:10,120
Could you please
transfer the call to him?

96
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:11,840
I'm here.

97
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,200
Hello, Mr. Fu.

98
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,600
I'm Xiao Huai's manager, Zhang Ying.

99
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:17,160
We've met before.

100
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:18,880
I'm terribly sorry.

101
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:21,040
I was overwhelmed
with work yesterday...

102
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,159
and only just found the time...

103
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,200
to give you a call today.

104
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,280
Regarding yesterday's news,

105
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:28,040
I'm very sorry.

106
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:30,199
I didn't expect that
after all this time,

107
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,400
it would still be leaked.

108
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:34,000
On our end, we're trying
to suppress the buzz.

109
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,360
But as you can see,

110
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:38,080
Xiao Huai is
so popular right now.

111
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,199
We just can't keep it down.

112
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,400
You can get straight to the point.

113
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:44,000
We'll keep looking
for ways to handle it.

114
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:45,560
We'll issue a statement today.

115
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:47,679
Is there anything specific...

116
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,960
you would like us to include?

117
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,040
Contact our PR Department directly.

118
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,240
(Li Zhi Huai)

119
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,520
Even more trouble.

120
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,439
(Speaker)

121
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,720
Hello, Ming Yu.

122
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:20,360
My manager...

123
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:22,120
should have called you by now.

124
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,360
I'm really sorry.

125
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,079
I didn't expect this matter...

126
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:27,680
would cause you so much trouble.

127
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,760
We're already handling it.

128
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,320
I'm truly sorry.

129
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,840
I've already handed it over
to the PR Department.

130
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:35,920
That may be so,

131
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,840
but I still feel quite bad about it.

132
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:40,400
How about this?

133
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,480
When I return to Jiangcheng
in a few days,

134
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:43,600
I'll treat you to a meal...

135
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,680
to apologize properly.

136
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:45,960
No need.

137
00:07:45,961 --> 00:07:47,880
There's no need
to create any unnecessary trouble.

138
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:50,640
As for the matter
I mentioned two days ago...

139
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,400
Contact the Marketing Department
directly.

140
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:55,040
I've already contacted Time Films.

141
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,840
I only care about the final result.

142
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:59,160
I won't get involved in the process.

143
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:02,640
Are you busy?

144
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,240
Yes, I'm busy.

145
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,680
I'm spending time
with my girlfriend.

146
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:08,760
Then I'll let you get back to it.

147
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,960
It's an aviation-themed movie.

148
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,720
Li Zhi Huai might
be the female lead.

149
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,800
The production team
reached out to us...

150
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,160
seeking a collaboration.

151
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,680
Is that all?

152
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,160
That's all.

153
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,640
Okay, I understand.

154
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,200
But if there's a next time,

155
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,600
you can go to my father's grave...

156
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,720
and explain it to him yourself.

157
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,600
Understood.

158
00:08:42,601 --> 00:08:43,840
By the way, my dad loved to drink.

159
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,200
- Xiao Ruan.
- Remember to bring some wine.

160
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,200
Mr. Fu,

161
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,720
she said she wants you
to drink with her father.

162
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,320
I heard her.

163
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,560
You too.

164
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,240
Ruan Si Xian,

165
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,680
well done.

166
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,679
You didn't just barge
into his office...

167
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,680
and give him a piece of your mind.

168
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,480
I would say you were
very mature and steady.

169
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:36,600
Your acting was great too.

170
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,760
I bet you really intimidated him.

171
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:43,800
That guy.

172
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,280
Even if he had
twice the guts next time,

173
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,720
he wouldn't dare try that again.

174
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,799
(Leave WeChat and open in Weibo.)

175
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:58,800
He's an old classmate of mine.

176
00:09:58,880 --> 00:09:59,960
He took time out
to visit my father.

177
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:01,879
We've been friends
for over a decade.

178
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:02,959
Don't overthink it, everyone.

179
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,760
If there's any good news,
I'll definitely let you all know.

180
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:06,560
(Weibo, Li Zhi Huai)

181
00:10:06,561 --> 00:10:08,079
(Fly to the Top of the Wealthy List)

182
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,240
So what do you think...

183
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,400
about this Weibo post?

184
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:12,840
I'm wondering the same thing.

185
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,880
Come on. What does she mean
by "took time out"?

186
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:18,200
How is that different
from an intentional visit?

187
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,719
And why didn't she mention
her dad was Fu Ming Yu's teacher?

188
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,799
(Fly to the Top of the Wealthy List)

189
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,520
Classmates are just classmates.

190
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,480
Why emphasize
"friends for over a decade"?

191
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,640
Exactly!

192
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:35,200
The day has come for Fu Ming Yu.

193
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,960
What are you laughing at now?

194
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,840
Fu Ming Yu's rumored girlfriend
just issued a statement.

195
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,440
Let me see.

196
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,160
This statement...

197
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:51,920
Something isn't right.

198
00:10:51,921 --> 00:10:53,199
I'm guessing she probably...

199
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,720
got rejected by Fu Ming Yu,

200
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,000
so she's trying to save face online.

201
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,359
Don't you think
the way she phrased it...

202
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:00,599
is clearly meant
to be an open-ended conclusion...

203
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,320
to leave it
to everyone's imagination?

204
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,760
She was already like this
back in school.

205
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:05,919
She always tried
to create the impression...

206
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,320
that everyone was in love with her.

207
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,720
But back then,
she really did like Fu Ming Yu.

208
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,400
But Fu Ming Yu
really didn't like her.

209
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,200
What about you?

210
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,680
It's even more impossible
for me to like her.

211
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,279
I have a sharp eye for people.

212
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,920
With one look,

213
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,280
I can tell
whether they're good or bad.

214
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,480
I stayed far away from her.

215
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,640
Then how could Fu Ming Yu
allow her to post such a statement?

216
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:33,960
He didn't.

217
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:36,520
The PR Department
would never have agreed to it.

218
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,960
When our PR Department
coordinated with them,

219
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:40,799
the requirements they set
were crystal clear.

220
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:41,880
Absolutely clear.

221
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:43,399
First, they must clarify
that you two...

222
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,680
were only high school classmates.

223
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:47,239
Second, they must also clarify...

224
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,400
exactly what you two did
when you met up.

225
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,960
Their studio
followed our instructions,

226
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,080
but I didn't expect...

227
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,280
Li Zhi Huai to post
a different version on her own.

228
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:57,439
Such a simple matter has been
made worse by explaining it,

229
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,840
escalating it to this point.

230
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:02,120
Tell the PR Department...

231
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:03,760
not to show any mercy.

232
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,240
Before the end of the day,
the buzz can stay high,

233
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,000
but the narrative must change.

234
00:12:08,280 --> 00:12:09,280
Okay.

235
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:13,400
You saw it yourself.

236
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,080
When she gets angry,

237
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,640
the consequences are severe.

238
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,519
- Indeed.
- Do you want to drink...

239
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:19,639
with her dad at the cemetery?

240
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:20,920
I'm allergic to alcohol.

241
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:23,520
Then hurry up
and order milk tea for everyone.

242
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:26,000
This all started because of me,

243
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,720
so someone has to fix it.

244
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,480
(Calls, Ruan Si Xian)

245
00:12:41,160 --> 00:12:43,640
Hello. The number you have dialed
is powered off.

246
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:47,120
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed
is powered off.

247
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:51,480
Hello. The number you have dialed
is powered off.

248
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,040
Ruan Si Xian.

249
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:18,920
Ruan Si Xian.

250
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:31,840
Hello. The number you have dialed
is powered off.

251
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:35,440
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed
is powered off.

252
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,119
(Another day of
watching the drama unfold.)

253
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,359
(Don't leave me hanging!
What happens next?)

254
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:42,120
(Who's this? Just a nobody trying
to get her 15 minutes of fame.)

255
00:13:43,160 --> 00:13:45,240
Why are there still
so many malicious comments?

256
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:47,320
Xiao Zhou, where did you go
this afternoon?

257
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,680
What am I even paying you for?

258
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,800
What's the point of
getting mad at her?

259
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:52,920
I told you not
to post anything on your own.

260
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,159
Everything must be aligned...

261
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:55,519
with the studio's
official statement.

262
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:57,280
Why didn't you listen?

263
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,039
And let me ask you,

264
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:02,160
what was the rush?

265
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:03,679
Regarding that female pilot project,

266
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:05,680
our negotiations were
almost finalized.

267
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:08,080
When the time comes, you just need
to focus on your acting.

268
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:11,439
And before you pull
these little stunts in private,

269
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:13,480
can't you give us a heads-up?

270
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,280
You've put us
in a very difficult position!

271
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:18,480
Rising stars are usually...

272
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:19,920
terrified of
their relationships leaking.

273
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,000
But look at you.

274
00:14:21,001 --> 00:14:22,680
It's like you want
the whole world to know!

275
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,520
The key is to find a good partner.

276
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,200
But you found someone
who is untouchable!

277
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:31,480
How was I supposed to know
that he already had a girlfriend?

278
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:34,920
Even if he didn't,
you still shouldn't have done this.

279
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,320
What do you think we are?
Some amateur studio?

280
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:42,520
Later,

281
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,240
hand over your social media accounts
to Xiao Zhou.

282
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,360
Ying.

283
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,520
I'm sorry. I know I was wrong.

284
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:55,040
I just really wanted that role.

285
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Ying.

286
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,520
Xiao Huai,

287
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,920
things are very difficult
for the company right now.

288
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,440
We'll see about the project later.

289
00:15:09,600 --> 00:15:10,600
Ruan Si Xian.

290
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:13,920
Ruan Si Xian.

291
00:15:13,921 --> 00:15:15,560
I can explain everything to you.

292
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,600
I know you're in there.

293
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,360
Can you open the door first?

294
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,120
What should I do?

295
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:15,560
- What are you doing?
- You finally opened the door.

296
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:19,680
Have you been crying?

297
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:23,080
Who's crying?

298
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:26,560
You don't think I was hiding
in here crying, do you?

299
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:30,040
Then why have you locked yourself
inside all afternoon?

300
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,200
I was studying.

301
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,719
There are so many exams every year.

302
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,080
Don't I need time to prepare?

303
00:16:46,280 --> 00:16:47,720
- Really?
- What else?

304
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,080
What's wrong with you?
Are you crazy?

305
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:52,640
You really gave me a fright.

306
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,280
Did you read
Li Zhi Huai's statement?

307
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:56,960
I read it on my way home.

308
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:00,400
This female classmate of yours
is quite interesting.

309
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:02,520
What about the latest one?

310
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:04,680
The latest one?

311
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:08,399
"Regarding
the recent online rumors..."

312
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:10,320
"about our vice president,
Mr. Fu Ming Yu,"

313
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,280
"we hereby
make the following statement."

314
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:15,919
"First, Mr. Fu Ming Yu
visited Ms. Li's father..."

315
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,640
"late last autumn..."

316
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:20,960
"because he was Mr. Fu's
high school homeroom teacher."

317
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:23,120
"Visiting a teacher
to show gratitude..."

318
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:25,680
"is a duty for everyone."

319
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,480
"Second,"

320
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,160
"Mr. Fu and Ms. Li..."

321
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:31,039
"have both been very busy..."

322
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:32,320
"in the 10 years since graduation."

323
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:33,920
"They have met three times
in total,"

324
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:36,160
"for a total of 2 hours
and 5 minutes of interaction."

325
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:37,840
"Two of those hours were spent..."

326
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:39,119
"at a chance encounter
at a gala last year..."

327
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:40,120
"and a small gathering
with the mentioned teacher."

328
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:41,680
"Being classmates is fate,"

329
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:42,920
"but that fate ends at graduation."

330
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,720
"Meeting again depends on luck."

331
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:47,800
"We hope everyone cherishes
their past school friendships."

332
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:50,440
"Third, Vice President Fu..."

333
00:17:50,680 --> 00:17:51,879
"is not single."

334
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:53,600
"He is in a stable relationship
with his girlfriend."

335
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:54,840
"Fourth,"

336
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:56,199
"log on
to the official Hengshi website..."

337
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,320
"to register as a member."

338
00:17:57,600 --> 00:18:00,440
"New spring travel routes
will be available soon."

339
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:03,640
"Enjoy your
Exclusive Flight Butler Service."

340
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:06,160
"The most beautiful routes are
at Hengshi."

341
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:08,199
Goodness, this is so satisfying!

342
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:09,520
I'm exhausted just from reading it.

343
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:12,319
I have to say,

344
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:13,720
the PR department was fast
this time.

345
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,400
This whole statement...

346
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:17,280
screams one message.

347
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:19,880
- "Stay away from him."
- They even threw in an ad.

348
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:22,360
As expected of a team trained
by Fu Ming Yu.

349
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,200
So what are the comments saying?

350
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:26,400
It's all mockery.

351
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:27,880
They're saying things like,

352
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:30,160
"The tables turned way too fast."

353
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,480
Why did she even bother?

354
00:18:32,360 --> 00:18:33,520
It's all for work.

355
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:35,080
It's all for survival, I guess.

356
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:38,040
Actually, everyone's way
of working is different.

357
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,600
It's just that she...

358
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,080
chose the dumbest way possible.

359
00:18:46,960 --> 00:18:48,720
I wonder how Ruan Ruan is
doing right now.

360
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:04,360
What are you laughing at?

361
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:05,680
How can you still laugh?

362
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:07,720
You're wasting
public resources, sir.

363
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,440
I'm laughing at myself.

364
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,360
I spent the whole afternoon
worried about you.

365
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:12,680
It was all for nothing.

366
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,360
Exactly.

367
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:15,520
You're "Captain" Ruan,

368
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:16,840
Ruan Si Xian.

369
00:19:17,280 --> 00:19:19,280
You wouldn't let
such a trivial matter get to you.

370
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,480
No,

371
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:21,920
I'm actually very petty.

372
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:25,520
But she's just
your high school classmate.

373
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:27,000
She's not even an ex-girlfriend.

374
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:28,999
If I have time to gossip,

375
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,400
I would rather study more.

376
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:32,080
Weirdos don't come around
every year,

377
00:19:32,320 --> 00:19:34,360
but professional exams happen
several times a year.

378
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:37,440
- Not mad anymore?
- Am I an air pump?

379
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:38,880
Why would I have
so much to vent?

380
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:41,679
Well, who was it this morning...

381
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:43,439
that barged into my office
in a murderous mood?

382
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,440
And treated me...

383
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:46,760
I can't be bothered
to be mad at her.

384
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:49,199
But you're the one who caused this.

385
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:50,200
I'm mad at you.

386
00:19:50,840 --> 00:19:53,240
I'm mad that you didn't come clean
the night you got back.

387
00:19:53,360 --> 00:19:55,279
I'm mad that you didn't
turn yourself in...

388
00:19:55,280 --> 00:19:56,280
the moment it happened.

389
00:19:57,840 --> 00:19:58,840
I'm sorry.

390
00:19:59,960 --> 00:20:00,960
It was indeed my fault.

391
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:02,920
It won't happen again.

392
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:05,320
Don't be mad.

393
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:07,160
But...

394
00:20:07,800 --> 00:20:09,080
is it that you don't trust me...

395
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:11,120
or that you care about me too much?

396
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:13,080
I don't know who's more anxious.

397
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:15,839
Anyway, someone stood
outside my door...

398
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,159
like a student
in time-out all afternoon.

399
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:18,560
And you're even sitting so close.

400
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,600
Okay, then I have to protest.

401
00:20:21,840 --> 00:20:22,999
What are you protesting?

402
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,319
You're the one who caused this mess.

403
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:26,000
- How dare you protest?
- Of course I'm going to protest.

404
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:28,200
Lately, you've been
pulling disappearing acts.

405
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:29,719
Didn't we have a deal?

406
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,360
As soon as you land,
you're supposed to let me know.

407
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:33,359
But every time you land,

408
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:35,000
contacting me isn't the first thing
you do after turning on your phone.

409
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:37,119
And now, you didn't
even say you were home.

410
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:38,800
I waited for you outside
all afternoon.

411
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,679
I couldn't see you,
you didn't answer my calls,

412
00:20:40,680 --> 00:20:41,680
and you didn't reply to my texts.

413
00:20:42,040 --> 00:20:43,120
Ruan Si Xian, I'm talking to you.

414
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:44,680
Do you have any idea
how worried I was?

415
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:46,800
What are you looking for?

416
00:20:47,960 --> 00:20:48,960
I'm looking for a way out of this.

417
00:20:50,080 --> 00:20:51,080
A way out?

418
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,360
There's no way out.

419
00:20:56,360 --> 00:20:57,440
- Put me down.
- No.

420
00:20:58,320 --> 00:20:59,760
- I have to find it too.
- I'm dizzy.

421
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,520
Does a pilot get dizzy?

422
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:04,960
Where's that way out you found?

423
00:21:08,080 --> 00:21:09,080
I'm hungry.

424
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,560
I want clam rice noodles.

425
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:11,960
I've been craving them for so long.

426
00:21:12,360 --> 00:21:14,280
You have someone so handsome
right here at home.

427
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:15,480
Instead of craving me,

428
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:17,400
you're craving clam rice noodles?

429
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:19,480
I don't care.

430
00:21:19,481 --> 00:21:21,040
You're being clingy again.

431
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:24,280
You're starting to interfere
with my normal life.

432
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:26,960
Fine.

433
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:29,320
I'm interfering
with "Captain" Ruan's normal life.

434
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:30,600
Then I'll just leave, okay?

435
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:33,280
If you're leaving,
you have to put me down first.

436
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,000
I found the way out.

437
00:21:38,320 --> 00:21:39,320
I'm leaving then.

438
00:21:40,440 --> 00:21:41,440
Who said you could leave?

439
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,400
Didn't you tell me to leave?

440
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:44,680
You leave just because I say so?

441
00:21:48,520 --> 00:21:49,599
See you at the noodle shop.

442
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:50,720
Last one there pays the bill!

443
00:21:55,320 --> 00:21:56,320
She kissed me.

444
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,880
As if you would ever be
the last one there.

445
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:09,880
Mr. Fu, the Catering Department
has prepared the new seasonal menu.

446
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:11,799
They've upgraded...

447
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:13,240
the special ordering system
for passengers.

448
00:22:13,840 --> 00:22:16,360
The tasting is currently scheduled
for this Friday at noon.

449
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,920
Isn't Friday when we have
the meeting with the film studio?

450
00:22:20,080 --> 00:22:21,960
Are we still going
to collaborate with them?

451
00:22:22,200 --> 00:22:23,200
The Brand Promotion Department...
has already
stopped coordinating with them.

452
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:26,120
Did I ever say I wanted
to terminate the collaboration?

453
00:22:26,840 --> 00:22:27,960
But things with Li Zhi Huai...

454
00:22:28,840 --> 00:22:29,840
have become so messy.

455
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:31,760
If the project is good,
why not invest?

456
00:22:32,160 --> 00:22:33,600
It's not like she is
the only actress available.

457
00:22:34,840 --> 00:22:35,840
Stop snacking.

458
00:22:36,760 --> 00:22:38,040
Name an actress you like.

459
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:39,320
Cheng Yi Ke.

460
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:42,279
Great, when we have dinner
with the producers,

461
00:22:42,280 --> 00:22:43,480
we can discuss the casting.

462
00:22:44,120 --> 00:22:46,840
Also, tell the PR Department
to keep in touch.

463
00:22:47,360 --> 00:22:48,360
Understood. Don't worry.

464
00:22:49,840 --> 00:22:51,680
- I'm looking forward to it.
- Everyone, watch your step.

465
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:53,920
- Please be careful.
- This way.

466
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:55,840
Sir, please watch your step.

467
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:57,360
Please show your boarding pass.

468
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:58,480
Watch your step.

469
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:00,720
Watch your step. Stay safe.

470
00:23:00,840 --> 00:23:01,840
Everyone, please watch your step.

471
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:03,040
Be careful.

472
00:23:03,240 --> 00:23:04,880
Welcome aboard Hengshi Air.

473
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:07,360
- Can you hold this for me?
- Sure, no problem.

474
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,280
Passengers, please watch your step.

475
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:12,200
Excuse me, sir.
Please stop taking photos.

476
00:23:12,480 --> 00:23:13,480
Please proceed with boarding.

477
00:23:33,560 --> 00:23:34,560
Your boarding pass, please.

478
00:23:39,560 --> 00:23:40,560
Your boarding pass, please.

479
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,040
Welcome aboard. Please head inside.

480
00:23:58,800 --> 00:24:00,400
Welcome aboard. Please head inside.

481
00:24:12,600 --> 00:24:14,760
Hello, sir. How can I help you?

482
00:24:16,640 --> 00:24:19,079
If you feel unwell
or need any assistance,

483
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,080
please feel free to call me.

484
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:33,320
Check it again.

485
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,160
Master, there's another one here.

486
00:24:40,080 --> 00:24:42,600
Captain, we found coins
in the engine's bypass duct.

487
00:24:43,040 --> 00:24:44,040
We suspect a passenger threw them.

488
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:48,000
Threw coins?

489
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:49,840
How many have you found so far?

490
00:24:50,080 --> 00:24:51,080
Only two.
I'm not sure if there are more.

491
00:24:52,520 --> 00:24:54,159
What era are we living in?

492
00:24:54,160 --> 00:24:55,320
Why are people still throwing coins?

493
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:56,920
This isn't the first time.

494
00:24:57,120 --> 00:24:58,360
It happens every few years.

495
00:24:58,680 --> 00:24:59,680
It's a real headache.
The police have been called.

496
00:25:00,680 --> 00:25:01,680
Okay, copy that.

497
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:04,480
We can't fly.

498
00:25:07,480 --> 00:25:09,160
When are we taking off?
Look at the time!

499
00:25:09,720 --> 00:25:11,400
Hello, sir. Please stay calm.

500
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,720
We'll take off as soon as possible.

501
00:25:12,721 --> 00:25:13,799
Please wait a moment.

502
00:25:13,800 --> 00:25:15,000
Ladies and gentlemen,

503
00:25:15,560 --> 00:25:18,080
the crew found two coins
near the aircraft.

504
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:20,119
If you threw these coins,

505
00:25:20,120 --> 00:25:21,160
please contact us immediately.

506
00:25:21,280 --> 00:25:22,320
Thank you.

507
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:24,280
No one is going to admit to that.

508
00:25:26,520 --> 00:25:27,680
- Call the police.
- Okay.

509
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:39,000
I already admitted I threw them.

510
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:41,800
So what if I did?
Can't you just pick them up?

511
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:43,440
I'll go pick them up for you.

512
00:25:44,360 --> 00:25:45,360
Wait.

513
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:46,960
How many coins
did you throw in total?

514
00:25:47,360 --> 00:25:48,360
Four.

515
00:25:48,361 --> 00:25:49,479
I only had four in my pocket.

516
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:50,800
I was supposed to throw nine.

517
00:25:51,760 --> 00:25:53,200
Do you know the consequences...

518
00:25:53,360 --> 00:25:54,360
of throwing these coins?

519
00:25:54,560 --> 00:25:55,760
I don't care about the consequences!

520
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:58,120
You guys at Hengshi
hired a female driver to fool us.

521
00:25:58,440 --> 00:25:59,680
Have you thought
about the consequences?

522
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,240
I only threw a few coins.
What's wrong
with praying for blessings?

523
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:05,400
Officer, I'm officially
filing a report now.

524
00:26:05,960 --> 00:26:07,680
Next, let's just follow
the standard procedure.

525
00:26:07,840 --> 00:26:09,240
You don't have
to file a police report.

526
00:26:09,920 --> 00:26:10,920
What did I even do?

527
00:26:10,921 --> 00:26:11,959
You really didn't do much.

528
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:13,360
You simply tossed some coins...

529
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,520
into the engine.

530
00:26:14,760 --> 00:26:15,960
This matter is
actually easy to handle.

531
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,160
It's just a matter of compensation.

532
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,440
It'll be about tens
of thousands of yuan.

533
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,759
But if I have
to have the engine removed,

534
00:26:20,760 --> 00:26:22,120
repaired, and then reinstalled,

535
00:26:22,840 --> 00:26:23,840
you'll owe
over a hundred thousand yuan.

536
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:30,200
And that "female driver"
you just mentioned...

537
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:33,000
is a female pilot hired
by Hengshi at a high salary.

538
00:26:34,320 --> 00:26:36,799
You are suspected of violating
Article 116 of the Criminal Law,

539
00:26:36,800 --> 00:26:38,079
the crime of sabotaging
of a transport vehicle.

540
00:26:38,080 --> 00:26:39,879
- Hello?
- We are accepting this case.

541
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:40,880
Please cooperate
with the investigation.
Have all four coins been found?

542
00:26:44,120 --> 00:26:45,640
They were indeed
in the engine, right?

543
00:26:46,120 --> 00:26:47,120
Okay, I understand.

544
00:26:50,440 --> 00:26:52,120
Officer, I'll leave the rest to you.

545
00:27:05,560 --> 00:27:06,560
How's the situation?

546
00:27:06,561 --> 00:27:07,959
Do you think he missed out...

547
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,000
on his nine years
of compulsory education?

548
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:11,480
If this plane had taken off,
it would have been a catastrophe.

549
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:12,800
He was "praying for blessings",

550
00:27:12,801 --> 00:27:14,160
but he almost sent everyone
to their graves.

551
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:17,439
And look, this plane...

552
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,240
It sounds like you're
quite heartbroken over it.

553
00:27:19,600 --> 00:27:21,760
Of course. How could I not be?

554
00:27:22,320 --> 00:27:23,960
Is it your family's plane?
Why are you so upset?

555
00:27:25,360 --> 00:27:27,399
During meetings, you tell us
to treat Hengshi as our home.

556
00:27:27,400 --> 00:27:28,400
Now you're saying it's not mine?

557
00:27:28,840 --> 00:27:30,480
So is Hengshi my home or not?

558
00:27:32,920 --> 00:27:34,080
As long as I am yours,

559
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:36,360
then Hengshi will
always be your home.

560
00:27:39,120 --> 00:27:40,120
I'm off.
Go on.

561
00:27:42,440 --> 00:27:43,440
Fly safe.

562
00:27:58,800 --> 00:27:59,800
Here.

563
00:28:02,280 --> 00:28:04,480
If you ask me, don't bother.

564
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:07,320
This video of yours...

565
00:28:07,760 --> 00:28:09,319
isn't as good as us
pretending to be a couple.

566
00:28:09,320 --> 00:28:10,320
That would get you views.
The account would grow so fast.

567
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:13,199
Am I some kind of masochist?

568
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,560
If I pretend
to be a couple with you,

569
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:16,600
and your entire company
of ex-girlfriends sees it,

570
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:18,760
they'll come to attack me
and get my account banned.

571
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:20,600
Look at this video.

572
00:28:20,800 --> 00:28:22,200
It has no highlights at all.

573
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:23,880
Who would want to watch this?

574
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:26,600
Then what highlights do you want?

575
00:28:28,760 --> 00:28:29,800
A video...

576
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,400
needs jokes, which you don't have.

577
00:28:31,840 --> 00:28:33,520
Or long legs, which you don't have.

578
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:36,559
You're just recording
the working lives...

579
00:28:36,560 --> 00:28:37,560
of these ordinary women.

580
00:28:37,561 --> 00:28:39,120
If this video gets over 100 likes,

581
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:40,560
I'll eat grapes
while doing a handstand.
Yan An, if you say one more word,

582
00:28:41,561 --> 00:28:44,320
I'll rip your legs off
and put them in this video.

583
00:28:45,120 --> 00:28:46,200
Even if no one watches it,

584
00:28:46,680 --> 00:28:48,479
I still want to make the videos
I want to make...

585
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,800
and express what I want to express.

586
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:52,079
Besides eating grapes all day,
what else can you do?

587
00:28:52,080 --> 00:28:53,760
You're just sitting here
criticizing my video.

588
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:55,040
Go away. I don't want to see you.

589
00:28:55,560 --> 00:28:56,719
- You're so annoying.
- I'm not leaving.

590
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:57,880
- I'll just watch you edit.
- Go away!

591
00:28:58,560 --> 00:28:59,599
Look at this.

592
00:28:59,600 --> 00:29:01,479
When you need me,
you call me "Brother An".

593
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:03,920
Now that you don't need me,
you're ready to kick me out.

594
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,440
Do you know what this is called?

595
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:07,120
The modern farmer and the viper.

596
00:29:07,560 --> 00:29:08,600
Mr. Dong Guo and the wolf.

597
00:29:09,200 --> 00:29:10,880
Zheng You An and Yan An.

598
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,639
- No!
- Eat it. Don't you love grapes?

599
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:15,959
- I can't eat it! I'm full!
- But you like them!

600
00:29:15,960 --> 00:29:17,440
I'm not eating! Help!

601
00:29:24,680 --> 00:29:25,720
- Dad.
- Mr. Zheng.

602
00:29:27,800 --> 00:29:28,800
Yan An is here too.

603
00:29:29,360 --> 00:29:30,360
What a coincidence.

604
00:29:31,960 --> 00:29:34,000
What brings you here today?

605
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:36,279
Since I opened this studio,

606
00:29:36,280 --> 00:29:37,519
you haven't cared or asked about it.

607
00:29:37,520 --> 00:29:39,200
Now you're here all of a sudden.

608
00:29:39,360 --> 00:29:42,000
What's going on?
Is the family business failing?

609
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,720
So this is your studio.

610
00:29:47,200 --> 00:29:49,159
Can you save the small talk?

611
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:50,880
What kind of question is that?

612
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,039
I'm standing right here.

613
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:53,360
If this isn't my studio,
what else could it be?

614
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:57,159
Don't tell me you came here
because you got lost,

615
00:29:57,160 --> 00:29:58,760
took a wrong turn,
and just wandered in by accident.

616
00:29:58,840 --> 00:30:00,360
Is that how you talk to your father?

617
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:01,560
I'm talking to you...

618
00:30:02,040 --> 00:30:03,080
the same way I always do.

619
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,400
- Yan An.
- Mr. Zheng.

620
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:16,880
Lately,

621
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:18,520
have you two been together
all the time?

622
00:30:18,720 --> 00:30:19,920
Not all the time.

623
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:22,800
At night, we still go
to our own homes.

624
00:30:23,640 --> 00:30:24,640
That's right.

625
00:30:26,560 --> 00:30:27,560
Sit down.

626
00:30:27,920 --> 00:30:28,959
Mr. Zheng, please, you sit.

627
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:30,040
I say, you sit.

628
00:30:44,240 --> 00:30:45,240
Yan An.

629
00:30:46,880 --> 00:30:48,000
You two...

630
00:30:48,840 --> 00:30:49,840
What exactly is...

631
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:51,760
your relationship?

632
00:30:52,080 --> 00:30:53,080
Old Zheng!

633
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:54,999
What exactly are you here for?

634
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:56,000
To conduct a census?

635
00:30:56,280 --> 00:30:57,280
I'm asking...

636
00:30:58,000 --> 00:30:59,359
I say one sentence,

637
00:30:59,360 --> 00:31:01,280
and you have a hundred
waiting for me.

638
00:31:01,360 --> 00:31:02,880
You asked,
but you won't let me speak.

639
00:31:06,360 --> 00:31:07,479
Yan An,

640
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:08,520
is everything okay at home lately?

641
00:31:08,960 --> 00:31:09,960
Everything is fine.

642
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:12,240
- Is your father well?
- My dad is fine.

643
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:13,920
My mom is doing well too.

644
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,240
Since you're always here,

645
00:31:17,800 --> 00:31:19,160
you haven't been helping
at home, right?

646
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:21,720
My family's business doesn't
really need me to manage it.

647
00:31:22,760 --> 00:31:24,880
You're a grown man now, right?

648
00:31:25,120 --> 00:31:27,320
Family matters must
be taken care of eventually.

649
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:30,320
Like me,
your father will get old too.

650
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,200
I understand.

651
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:36,080
As you know, I only have An An,
my one precious daughter.

652
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:39,440
If you two are dating,

653
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:41,000
I'm not some feudal patriarch.

654
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:42,200
I won't object.

655
00:31:42,800 --> 00:31:45,720
But I have two requests
that you must promise me.

656
00:31:46,520 --> 00:31:47,760
Please go ahead.

657
00:31:52,040 --> 00:31:53,600
First,

658
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:56,200
I don't care about your past.

659
00:31:56,360 --> 00:31:57,360
But from now on,

660
00:31:57,361 --> 00:31:58,959
you must clear up
all those messy affairs,

661
00:31:58,960 --> 00:32:00,160
meaning those relationships
with women.

662
00:32:00,600 --> 00:32:01,600
Get them sorted out.

663
00:32:04,080 --> 00:32:05,080
Secondly,

664
00:32:05,081 --> 00:32:07,719
although the Zheng family
has faced some issues lately...

665
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:08,960
and some minor difficulties,

666
00:32:09,320 --> 00:32:10,840
we still have a family business.

667
00:32:11,960 --> 00:32:12,960
I hope...

668
00:32:14,240 --> 00:32:16,000
that you can take charge
in the future.

669
00:32:17,080 --> 00:32:18,080
I understand. No problem.

670
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:20,840
What do you mean, "no problem"?

671
00:32:21,200 --> 00:32:22,319
I have a problem.

672
00:32:22,320 --> 00:32:24,239
And you said you weren't
a feudal patriarch.

673
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:25,999
Look at you.
What kind of behavior is this?

674
00:32:26,000 --> 00:32:27,280
You're not like this at home.

675
00:32:27,520 --> 00:32:29,959
What family business requires him
to be the one to take charge?

676
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:31,080
Can't I do it?

677
00:32:31,120 --> 00:32:33,280
Why do you trust him so much?
I get it now.

678
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:34,719
You've been pressuring me
to get married...

679
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:36,599
because, in reality,
you're just looking for an heir.

680
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:39,279
If that's the case, just transfer
your assets to him directly.

681
00:32:39,280 --> 00:32:41,119
Why go through all this trouble
and put in so much effort?

682
00:32:41,120 --> 00:32:42,359
I'm your only daughter.

683
00:32:42,360 --> 00:32:43,799
But you never let me
handle any family business.

684
00:32:43,800 --> 00:32:45,880
You would rather trust him
than trust me!

685
00:32:46,600 --> 00:32:47,640
And you call this spoiling me?

686
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:52,600
I'm telling your mom!

687
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:55,080
All you do is tell Mom! You...

688
00:32:57,360 --> 00:32:59,000
What is slamming a card down
supposed to mean?

689
00:32:59,320 --> 00:33:00,320
Take care, Mr. Zheng.

690
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:07,240
I can't use the simulator
without a booking.

691
00:33:09,080 --> 00:33:11,040
There are no movies I want to see.

692
00:33:11,360 --> 00:33:12,840
I don't want to go home either.

693
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:15,600
This day off is useless to me.

694
00:33:31,400 --> 00:33:32,400
Waiting for a car?

695
00:33:33,280 --> 00:33:34,440
No, I'm waiting for you.

696
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:36,680
Waiting for me?

697
00:33:38,120 --> 00:33:39,120
Is something the matter?

698
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:41,920
Actually,

699
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:45,080
there's something I would like
to ask you about.

700
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:47,720
Go ahead.

701
00:33:47,840 --> 00:33:49,600
When you quit to go
to the aviation academy,

702
00:33:51,120 --> 00:33:52,360
that must have
been a tough decision.

703
00:34:06,520 --> 00:34:07,560
In this world,

704
00:34:07,920 --> 00:34:09,200
there really are
no permanent enemies.

705
00:34:09,720 --> 00:34:11,600
The two of them can sit down
and have a drink together now.

706
00:34:13,200 --> 00:34:14,840
Isn't that how it is with you women?

707
00:34:15,520 --> 00:34:17,520
Long-term unions lead to splits,
and long-term splits lead to unions.

708
00:34:18,240 --> 00:34:20,160
Since you were kids, it has been,
"I'm friends with you today,"

709
00:34:20,520 --> 00:34:21,520
"but not tomorrow."

710
00:34:21,521 --> 00:34:23,440
Don't give me that "you women" talk.

711
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:25,640
Don't you men ever fall out
and then make up?

712
00:34:26,120 --> 00:34:27,120
Get back to work.

713
00:34:27,880 --> 00:34:29,640
Anyway, I'm quite sorry.

714
00:34:30,200 --> 00:34:31,520
Whether you forgive me or not,

715
00:34:32,720 --> 00:34:34,120
I should apologize sincerely...

716
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:35,520
for everything I've done...

717
00:34:35,720 --> 00:34:37,080
to you in the past.

718
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:38,760
That's all in the past.

719
00:34:39,040 --> 00:34:40,040
Mainly because...

720
00:34:40,720 --> 00:34:41,720
those things...

721
00:34:42,160 --> 00:34:43,520
didn't really hurt me.

722
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:45,240
Still, I shouldn't have done them.

723
00:34:47,560 --> 00:34:49,920
I'm being thick-skinned
coming to you,

724
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:52,600
but I don't know anyone else...

725
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:54,280
who has had a similar experience.

726
00:34:55,960 --> 00:34:57,640
Do you want to quit
and go to flight school?

727
00:34:58,680 --> 00:35:00,360
I'm over the age limit.
It's not about flight school.

728
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:03,640
But I do want to resign.

729
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,400
However,

730
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:07,240
I haven't fully made up my mind yet.

731
00:35:08,280 --> 00:35:09,680
So I wanted to ask you,

732
00:35:10,560 --> 00:35:12,680
how were you so resolute back then?

733
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:16,280
At the time,

734
00:35:16,600 --> 00:35:18,680
I was partly acting out of spite.

735
00:35:19,560 --> 00:35:20,720
I just gritted my teeth and did it.

736
00:35:22,920 --> 00:35:24,760
Why do you suddenly want to quit?

737
00:35:27,560 --> 00:35:28,560
Maybe...

738
00:35:30,200 --> 00:35:32,080
I just feel like there is
no hope for the future.

739
00:35:33,480 --> 00:35:35,880
It's like I've run into a dead end.

740
00:35:36,680 --> 00:35:37,840
You could transfer
to another department.

741
00:35:38,640 --> 00:35:41,520
Besides, Hengshi doesn't
have many pursers...

742
00:35:41,640 --> 00:35:42,719
as seasoned as you.

743
00:35:42,720 --> 00:35:44,000
Maybe in a few years,

744
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:46,040
you'll be promoted to management.

745
00:35:46,080 --> 00:35:47,080
There's still hope.

746
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:52,200
Why does that sound so familiar?

747
00:35:53,640 --> 00:35:54,640
But then again,

748
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:56,720
being a flight attendant...

749
00:35:57,640 --> 00:35:58,800
did give me a lot.

750
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:03,520
At least it allowed me
to leave my original home.

751
00:36:04,040 --> 00:36:05,040
But Xiao Ruan, you know what?

752
00:36:05,041 --> 00:36:07,319
The ironic thing is,
all my motivation in the past...

753
00:36:07,320 --> 00:36:08,480
was actually driven...

754
00:36:09,120 --> 00:36:12,000
by the desire
to have a family of my own.

755
00:36:12,600 --> 00:36:14,840
So I worked hard
for a long time to achieve that.

756
00:36:15,760 --> 00:36:18,080
I tolerated Yue Yang
time and time again.

757
00:36:20,160 --> 00:36:22,240
Then I went to you
to mark my territory.

758
00:36:22,400 --> 00:36:23,599
In the end, I found out...

759
00:36:23,600 --> 00:36:24,800
that he didn't like me at all.

760
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:27,280
All the beauty
was just my imagination.

761
00:36:28,560 --> 00:36:29,599
I often thought,

762
00:36:29,600 --> 00:36:31,079
"I, Jiang Zi Yue,
am so outstanding."

763
00:36:31,080 --> 00:36:32,879
"How could you, Yue Yang,
not like me?"

764
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:33,999
"Why don't you like me?"

765
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:35,400
"How could you
possibly not like me?"

766
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,960
But later,
after going through so much,

767
00:36:43,840 --> 00:36:45,520
I think I've grown a little.

768
00:36:46,680 --> 00:36:47,680
At least now,

769
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:52,280
I can accept the fact
that someone doesn't like me.

770
00:36:54,720 --> 00:36:56,840
You know what?
Sometimes I really envy you.

771
00:36:58,040 --> 00:37:00,080
To be honest, that envy...

772
00:37:01,120 --> 00:37:02,240
is tinged with a bit of resentment.

773
00:37:03,120 --> 00:37:04,520
Maybe that's just human nature.

774
00:37:05,480 --> 00:37:07,320
I often tell myself not
to think that way.

775
00:37:08,040 --> 00:37:10,280
But I just can't control myself.

776
00:37:10,440 --> 00:37:11,680
I feel so indignant.

777
00:37:12,200 --> 00:37:13,640
Why is it that despite my hard work,

778
00:37:13,720 --> 00:37:15,920
I'm always just a little bit
behind others?

779
00:37:18,200 --> 00:37:20,399
The things I've wanted
since I was a kid,

780
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:22,119
the things I've longed for,

781
00:37:22,120 --> 00:37:23,640
I've never actually gotten them.

782
00:37:32,720 --> 00:37:34,640
Do you think
I'm asking for too much?

783
00:37:36,120 --> 00:37:37,520
Is that why I'm so unhappy?

784
00:37:38,560 --> 00:37:39,840
What's wrong with wanting things?

785
00:37:41,600 --> 00:37:42,960
You deserve them.

786
00:37:43,640 --> 00:37:44,879
And all these years,

787
00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:46,240
you've worked harder than anyone.

788
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:48,240
You're also better than anyone.

789
00:37:48,640 --> 00:37:49,720
You just met someone...

790
00:37:50,040 --> 00:37:51,160
who let you down.

791
00:37:53,360 --> 00:37:55,440
You can't deny yourself like this...

792
00:37:55,800 --> 00:37:57,200
just because of a recent setback.

793
00:37:57,640 --> 00:37:59,600
If you want to find someone
who won't let you down...

794
00:37:59,800 --> 00:38:00,960
or betray you,

795
00:38:03,240 --> 00:38:04,240
that person is yourself.

796
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:19,640
So it's not too late, right?

797
00:38:21,520 --> 00:38:22,920
Do you also think
there's still hope for me?

798
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:36,239
Get away from me!

799
00:38:36,240 --> 00:38:37,519
Why are you so angry?

800
00:38:37,520 --> 00:38:39,199
Didn't you take the card?

801
00:38:39,200 --> 00:38:41,159
I told you, I'm not going
to use that money.

802
00:38:41,160 --> 00:38:43,119
- Don't follow me!
- Why are you so mad at me?

803
00:38:43,120 --> 00:38:44,440
I didn't do anything to you.

804
00:38:44,680 --> 00:38:45,680
Yan An,

805
00:38:46,600 --> 00:38:47,999
we've been hanging out for so long,

806
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:49,119
flirting back and forth,

807
00:38:49,120 --> 00:38:51,039
but you haven't confessed once,
nor have you made any promises.

808
00:38:51,040 --> 00:38:52,199
Then today,
as soon as my dad shows up,

809
00:38:52,200 --> 00:38:54,119
you just go ahead and take over
the Zheng family business.

810
00:38:54,120 --> 00:38:55,400
You're quite good at taking
what others worked for!

811
00:38:56,800 --> 00:38:58,119
I didn't take your family business.

812
00:38:58,120 --> 00:38:59,679
Your dad forced it on me.

813
00:38:59,680 --> 00:39:00,680
Forced?

814
00:39:02,680 --> 00:39:03,680
So you just took it?

815
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:05,200
He gave it, and you just took it?

816
00:39:05,920 --> 00:39:07,520
I was just scared
at the time, so I accepted it.

817
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:09,080
But I won't actually keep it.

818
00:39:11,040 --> 00:39:12,080
What if he gave me to you?
Would you take me?

819
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:24,520
We're buddies.
Why are you saying things like that?

820
00:39:26,880 --> 00:39:27,880
Yan An,

821
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:29,520
you're a real piece of work.

822
00:39:30,560 --> 00:39:31,560
Don't follow me.

823
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:33,680
Zheng You An, let me explain!

824
00:39:33,840 --> 00:39:36,039
Don't run! Watch the steps.
Seriously, don't run.

825
00:39:36,040 --> 00:39:37,480
- Go away!
- Zheng You An!

826
00:39:38,560 --> 00:39:39,760
Xuan!

827
00:39:40,720 --> 00:39:42,160
Give me your strongest drink.

828
00:39:43,040 --> 00:39:44,439
Isn't this the one
who had a Long Island Iced Tea...

829
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:45,800
and ended up under the table?

830
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:47,920
You're here early today.
They're over there.

831
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:53,879
Ms. Ruan!

832
00:39:53,880 --> 00:39:56,680
I've been so wronged today.

833
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:58,360
What happened now?

834
00:39:58,760 --> 00:39:59,960
It's so good that you're here.

835
00:40:00,240 --> 00:40:02,160
You have to stay with me tonight.

836
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:03,680
We're drinking until we drop.

837
00:40:04,240 --> 00:40:06,159
I have so much to vent about.

838
00:40:06,160 --> 00:40:07,999
- I know only you understand me.
- Okay.

839
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:09,240
Don't just wail.
Tell me what happened.

840
00:40:09,560 --> 00:40:10,840
Let me have a drink first.

841
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:14,279
Xuan, drinks!

842
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:16,119
Coming!

843
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:18,400
Before you have strong liquor,
shouldn't you eat something first?

844
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:20,000
The strong stuff is coming right up.

845
00:40:23,640 --> 00:40:25,680
And who's this?

846
00:40:26,360 --> 00:40:30,000
She's Zi Yue,
a purser at our airline.

847
00:40:31,320 --> 00:40:32,520
Zi Yue.

848
00:40:35,160 --> 00:40:36,600
You've been crying.

849
00:40:36,680 --> 00:40:38,799
It's nothing.
I just got a little emotional.

850
00:40:38,800 --> 00:40:39,800
Who upset you?

851
00:40:39,801 --> 00:40:41,520
Tell me. I'll give them
a piece of my mind.

852
00:40:42,200 --> 00:40:43,960
Let me tell you,
you'll feel better once you vent.

853
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:45,360
Don't cry.

854
00:40:47,560 --> 00:40:49,200
Don't give her too much.

855
00:40:49,360 --> 00:40:50,560
Just a tiny bit will do.

856
00:40:50,720 --> 00:40:52,040
Any less and there would be nothing.

857
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:56,199
See what you would like to drink.

858
00:40:56,200 --> 00:40:57,319
I'll just have water today.

859
00:40:57,320 --> 00:40:58,320
Who upset you?

860
00:40:58,321 --> 00:40:59,839
Tell me. I'll give them
a piece of my mind.

861
00:40:59,840 --> 00:41:00,959
Who knows how drunk she'll get?

862
00:41:00,960 --> 00:41:02,280
Don't worry, I won't give her much.

863
00:41:07,640 --> 00:41:09,840
Are you two together?

864
00:41:14,720 --> 00:41:16,359
The likes of me?

865
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:17,360
Just an ordinary friend.

866
00:41:18,720 --> 00:41:20,120
At least you're self-aware.

867
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:32,880
I'm so mad my fists are clenched.

868
00:41:33,080 --> 00:41:34,480
Why wasn't I on that flight?

869
00:41:34,720 --> 00:41:36,079
If I were there,
I would grab him by the collar...

870
00:41:36,080 --> 00:41:37,560
and give him a few slaps!

871
00:41:37,720 --> 00:41:38,720
What did he mean by that?

872
00:41:39,240 --> 00:41:40,600
Tossing coins?

873
00:41:41,040 --> 00:41:43,960
He thinks we women can't
do these things well, right?

874
00:41:44,240 --> 00:41:46,840
My dad is exactly like him.

875
00:41:47,120 --> 00:41:49,160
He doesn't trust me
with our family's hotel.

876
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,840
He insists on handing it over
to an outsider like him.

877
00:41:51,120 --> 00:41:52,319
I don't even know why!

878
00:41:52,320 --> 00:41:53,480
Just because he's a man?

879
00:41:53,760 --> 00:41:55,680
What kind of relationship
does he have with our family?

880
00:41:55,920 --> 00:41:58,520
He and my dad aren't even related.

881
00:41:58,800 --> 00:42:00,519
Even between him and me,
we're just...

882
00:42:00,520 --> 00:42:01,520
Ordinary friends.

883
00:42:04,280 --> 00:42:05,280
He just said it.

884
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:08,600
Yes.

885
00:42:09,280 --> 00:42:10,720
Ordinary friends.

886
00:42:12,680 --> 00:42:14,400
He doesn't even have the guts
to pursue me.

887
00:42:14,640 --> 00:42:16,559
He doesn't even dare!
What a cowardly man!

888
00:42:16,560 --> 00:42:17,799
Tell me,
what does my dad see in him?

889
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:18,999
I really don't get it!

890
00:42:19,000 --> 00:42:20,400
He's unbelievably cowardly! I...

891
00:42:21,800 --> 00:42:22,800
Drink slowly.

892
00:42:26,080 --> 00:42:27,120
Wait, something's not right.

893
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:28,400
What's wrong?

894
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:30,600
I've drunk so much,

895
00:42:31,560 --> 00:42:33,120
but my head is still so clear.

896
00:42:34,720 --> 00:42:37,560
Xuan, is your alcohol fake
or something?

897
00:42:39,040 --> 00:42:40,640
Don't say things like that.

898
00:42:41,080 --> 00:42:42,520
This is a legitimate bar.

899
00:42:43,960 --> 00:42:44,960
Yan An.

900
00:42:45,760 --> 00:42:46,760
Get me something strong.

901
00:42:47,640 --> 00:42:48,640
- Okay.
- Hurry up.

902
00:42:50,160 --> 00:42:51,440
- Make it weak.
- Of course.

903
00:42:55,760 --> 00:42:56,799
It really doesn't
taste like alcohol.

904
00:42:56,800 --> 00:42:58,720
Miss, do you need anything else?

905
00:42:59,240 --> 00:43:00,240
- Go away.
- Understood.

906
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:04,280
All right. You guys stay
and have fun.

907
00:43:04,880 --> 00:43:05,880
I have things to do tomorrow,

908
00:43:06,360 --> 00:43:07,560
so I'll head out first.

909
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:11,079
Zi Yue, did I talk too much
just now?

910
00:43:11,080 --> 00:43:12,080
- Not at all.
- Wait.

911
00:43:12,081 --> 00:43:14,119
I actually enjoyed listening to you.

912
00:43:14,120 --> 00:43:15,120
- Then I...
- All right.

913
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:17,200
She has a flight tomorrow.
I'll see her out.

914
00:43:17,480 --> 00:43:18,480
Don't drink too much.

915
00:43:18,640 --> 00:43:20,000
Zi Yue,

916
00:43:20,600 --> 00:43:22,839
in the future,
if anyone messes with you,

917
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:24,199
just tell me, and I'll give them
a piece of my mind.

918
00:43:24,200 --> 00:43:25,600
If I can't out-talk them,
I'll just hit them!

919
00:43:27,120 --> 00:43:28,600
What are you doing, ordinary friend?

920
00:43:29,560 --> 00:43:30,560
What are you talking about?

921
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:40,760
(Departing Ep. 17 for Ep. 18)
